# menu: skip the intro and reach the main menu.
#
# The intro-skip count is not deterministic (it depends on which intro frame
# is showing when each key lands), so this sends two Enters with generous
# gaps, then Esc. Esc is "Previous menu": if the 2nd Enter only cleared the
# intro, Esc on the main menu itself is a harmless no-op; if the 2nd Enter
# also opened the "Start Racing" submenu (intro cleared unusually fast),
# Esc backs out of it to the main menu. Either way this lands cleanly on the
# main menu. Verified with screenshots.
enter w2000
enter w1800
esc w1200
